## Rules that apply to every route

- Every tool runs on its subscription login. API keys are banned. Never set, store or ask for one.
- The helper definitions in `~/.claude/agents/` bill the Claude plan of the person logged in:
  haiku-helper pins Claude Haiku 5.5 at effort max (Claude Code 2.1.293 or newer); explore,
  researcher, implementer and verifier pin Claude Sonnet 5.5 at effort high (Claude Code 2.1.284
  or newer; on an older Claude Code the installer puts in the previous copies, Claude Sonnet 4.6 at
  effort max, and the Routes section above says so).
- To update or remove this install, run the packet's installer again (`--uninstall` to undo). Do
  not edit the installed files by hand; ask the packet owner for a newer packet instead.
